flowchart TD
  A[Form intake] --> B[Normalize submission]
  B --> C{Duplicate or prior record?}
  C -- New applicant --> D[Create review queue item]
  C -- Existing applicant --> E[Attach to existing profile]
  D --> F{Human decision}
  E --> F
  F -- Approve --> G[CRM/database upsert]
  F -- Reject --> H[Record rejection reason]
  F -- Revoke --> I[Disable access]
  G --> J[Provision access]
  J --> K[Send approval notification]
  H --> L[Send rejection notification]
  I --> M[Send revocation notification]
  J --> N{Provisioning failed?}
  N -- Yes --> O[Recovery queue]
  N -- No --> P[Completed audit record]
  O --> Q[Replay after fix]
  Q --> J

